{"seq":2,"slug":"keyboard-focus-management","title":"键盘与焦点管理：让界面对键盘完全可操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-engineering/implementation/keyboard-focus-management","wordCount":1158,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"键盘与焦点管理-让界面对键盘完全可操作\">键盘与焦点管理：让界面对键盘完全可操作</h1><p>键盘可访问性是无障碍工程中最关键的维度之一。屏幕阅读器用户、运动障碍用户和开关控制用户都依赖键盘操作。WCAG 2.1.1 要求所有功能均可通过键盘访问，且不因按键时机产生问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>键盘管理包含三个层面：<strong>Tab 顺序</strong>（焦点在交互元素间的移动序列）、<strong>焦点可见性</strong>（当前焦点位置的视觉指示）和<strong>焦点陷阱</strong>（模态对话框等需要将焦点锁定在组件内的场景）。正确的焦点管理是复杂交互组件（模态框、菜单、标签页）无障碍的核心工程挑战。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tab-顺序的基本规则\">Tab 顺序的基本规则</h2><p>HTML 默认的 Tab 顺序遵循文档流，可聚焦元素按 DOM 顺序获得焦点：</p>\n<p><strong>原生可聚焦元素</strong>（无需 tabindex）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>&lt;a href&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;button&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;input&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;select&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;textarea&gt;</code></li>\n<li><code>&lt;details&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;summary&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;audio controls&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;video controls&gt;</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>tabindex 的正确使用</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>tabindex 值</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>tabindex=&quot;0&quot;</code></td>\n<td>加入 Tab 顺序，按 DOM 位置排序</td>\n<td>使非原生元素可聚焦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;</code></td>\n<td>不在 Tab 顺序内，可编程聚焦</td>\n<td>焦点管理目标元素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tabindex=&quot;1+&quot;</code></td>\n<td><strong>不要使用</strong></td>\n<td>破坏自然 Tab 顺序</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// tabindex=&quot;-1&quot; 的典型用法：跳过链接&#10;const skipLink = document.querySelector(&#39;#skip-to-main&#39;);&#10;document.querySelector(&#39;#main-content&#39;).setAttribute(&#39;tabindex&#39;, &#39;-1&#39;);&#10;// 用户按下跳过链接时，编程聚焦到 main&#10;skipLink.addEventListener(&#39;click&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  document.querySelector(&#39;#main-content&#39;).focus();&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// tabindex=\"-1\" 的典型用法：跳过链接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> skipLink</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">querySelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#skip-to-main'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">querySelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#main-content'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setAttribute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tabindex'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'-1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 用户按下跳过链接时，编程聚焦到 main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">skipLink.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'click'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">querySelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#main-content'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">focus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Tab 顺序与视觉顺序一致</strong>（WCAG 1.3.2 / 2.4.3）：CSS <code>order</code>、<code>float</code>、<code>position</code> 可以改变视觉顺序而不改变 DOM 顺序，导致 Tab 顺序与视觉位置不一致。应优先通过调整 DOM 顺序来匹配视觉顺序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"焦点可见性\">焦点可见性</h2><p>WCAG 2.4.7（AA）要求键盘焦点有可见指示器；WCAG 2.4.11（AA，2.2 新增）要求焦点元素不被粘性内容完全遮挡；WCAG 2.4.12（AAA）要求焦点元素完全可见。</p>\n<p><strong>浏览器默认焦点样式的问题</strong>：不同浏览器的默认 <code>outline</code> 样式差异很大，且通常设计上不够醒目。</p>\n<p><strong>正确的焦点样式实践</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 方案一：增强原生 outline，不破坏高对比度模式 */&#10;:focus-visible {&#10;  outline: 3px solid #005fcc;&#10;  outline-offset: 2px;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 方案二：自定义焦点样式，同时保留高对比度支持 */&#10;:focus-visible {&#10;  outline: 2px solid transparent; /* 高对比度模式下会变为可见 */&#10;  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #005fcc;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 错误：完全移除焦点样式 */&#10;:focus {&#10;  outline: none;&#10;} /* 不要这样做 */\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 方案一：增强原生 outline，不破坏高对比度模式 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:focus-visible</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  outline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> solid</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> #005fcc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  outline-offset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 方案二：自定义焦点样式，同时保留高对比度支持 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:focus-visible</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  outline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> solid</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> transparent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 高对比度模式下会变为可见 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  box-shadow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> #005fcc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 错误：完全移除焦点样式 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:focus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  outline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">none</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 不要这样做 */</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>:focus-visible</code> 的优势：鼠标点击时不显示焦点环（避免视觉干扰），键盘导航时显示焦点环（满足无障碍要求）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"焦点陷阱-模态对话框的焦点管理\">焦点陷阱：模态对话框的焦点管理</h2><p>模态对话框必须实现&quot;焦点陷阱&quot;——焦点被锁定在对话框内，不能 Tab 到背景内容，但用户可以在对话框内部正常导航。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"class FocusTrap {&#10;  constructor(container) {&#10;    this.container = container;&#10;    this.focusableSelector = [&#10;      &#39;a[href]&#39;,&#10;      &#39;button:not([disabled])&#39;,&#10;      &#39;input:not([disabled])&#39;,&#10;      &#39;select:not([disabled])&#39;,&#10;      &#39;textarea:not([disabled])&#39;,&#10;      &#39;[tabindex]:not([tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;])&#39;,&#10;    ].join(&#39;,&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  getFocusableElements() {&#10;    return [...this.container.querySelectorAll(this.focusableSelector)].filter(&#10;      (el) =&gt; !el.closest(&#39;[aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;]&#39;),&#10;    );&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  activate() {&#10;    const focusable = this.getFocusableElements();&#10;    if (focusable.length === 0) return;&#10;&#10;    const firstEl = focusable[0];&#10;    const lastEl = focusable[focusable.length - 1];&#10;&#10;    this.handleKeyDown = (e) =&gt; {&#10;      if (e.key !== &#39;Tab&#39;) return;&#10;      if (e.shiftKey) {&#10;        if (document.activeElement === firstEl) {&#10;          e.preventDefault();&#10;          lastEl.focus();&#10;        }&#10;      } else {&#10;        if (document.activeElement === lastEl) {&#10;          e.preventDefault();&#10;          firstEl.focus();&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    };&#10;&#10;    this.container.addEventListener(&#39;keydown&#39;, this.handleKeyDown);&#10;    firstEl.focus(); // 打开时聚焦到第一个元素&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  deactivate(returnFocusTo) {&#10;    this.container.removeEventListener(&#39;keydown&#39;, this.handleKeyDown);&#10;    if (returnFocusTo) returnFocusTo.focus(); // 关闭时还原焦点&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FocusTrap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.container </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> container;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.focusableSelector </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'a[href]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'button:not([disabled])'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'input:not([disabled])'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'select:not([disabled])'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'textarea:not([disabled])'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      '[tabindex]:not([tabindex=\"-1\"])'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">','</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  getFocusableElements</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark: