<span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Esc 键关闭</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">modal.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'keydown'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (e.key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Escape'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">closeModal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> closeModal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  modal.hidden </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  trap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">deactivate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(openBtn); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 焦点归还给触发按钮</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>aria-modal=&quot;true&quot;</code> 告知 AT 背景内容不可访问（部分屏幕阅读器依赖此属性决定是否跳过背景内容）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"旁路导航-skip-navigation\">旁路导航（Skip Navigation）</h2><p>页面顶部应提供跳过导航链接，让键盘用户可以直接跳到主要内容区（WCAG 2.4.1）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;a href=&quot;#main-content&quot; class=&quot;skip-link&quot;&gt;跳到主要内容&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;nav&gt;&lt;!-- 导航菜单 --&gt;&lt;/nav&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;main id=&quot;main-content&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;!-- 主要内容 --&gt;&#10;&lt;/main&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">a</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> href</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#main-content\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"skip-link\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>跳到主要内容&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 导航菜单 --></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">main</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"main-content\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tabindex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"-1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  &#x3C;!-- 主要内容 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".skip-link {&#10;  position: absolute;&#10;  top: -100%;&#10;  left: 0;&#10;}&#10;&#10;.skip-link:focus {&#10;  top: 0; /* 只在获得焦点时可见 */&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.skip-link</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">absolute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  top</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  left</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.skip-link:focus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  top</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 只在获得焦点时可见 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"复合组件的键盘交互模式\">复合组件的键盘交互模式</h2><p>ARIA Authoring Practices Guide（APG）定义了复合组件的键盘交互规范：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>必要键盘支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标签页（Tablist）</td>\n<td>Tab 进入，方向键切换标签，Enter/Space 选中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>菜单（Menu）</td>\n<td>Tab 进入，方向键导航，Enter 激活，Esc 关闭</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>树形控件（Tree）</td>\n<td>方向键导航，Enter 激活，右/左键展开/折叠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组合框（Combobox）</td>\n<td>Alt+Down 打开，方向键选择，Enter 确认，Esc 关闭</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轮播（Carousel）</td>\n<td>方向键前后，可暂停自动播放</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    TabKey[Tab 键进入组件] --&gt; Focus[聚焦到活跃项]&#10;    Focus --&gt; Arrow[方向键在组件内导航]&#10;    Arrow --&gt; Enter[Enter/Space 激活]&#10;    Enter --&gt; Esc[Esc 关闭/返回父级]&#10;    Esc --&gt; Return[焦点返回触发元素]\">flowchart TD\n    TabKey[Tab 键进入组件] --&gt; Focus[聚焦到活跃项]\n    Focus --&gt; Arrow[方向键在组件内导航]\n    Arrow --&gt; Enter[Enter/Space 激活]\n    Enter --&gt; Esc[Esc 关闭/返回父级]\n    Esc --&gt; Return[焦点返回触发元素]</pre><h2 id=\"常见焦点管理缺陷\">常见焦点管理缺陷</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缺陷</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>修复方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>焦点丢失</td>\n<td>动态删除元素后焦点消失到 body</td>\n<td>删除前将焦点移到邻近元素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>焦点不可见</td>\n<td>CSS 移除了 outline</td>\n<td>使用 <code>:focus-visible</code> 设置可见样式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>焦点顺序混乱</td>\n<td>Tab 顺序与视觉不符</td>\n<td>调整 DOM 顺序，避免 tabindex 正整数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幽灵焦点</td>\n<td>焦点进入 aria-hidden 区域</td>\n<td>不在可聚焦元素上用 aria-hidden</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模态框焦点泄漏</td>\n<td>Tab 可以到达背景内容</td>\n<td>实现焦点陷阱</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与相关章节的关系\">与相关章节的关系</h2><p><a href=\"semantic-html-aria\">语义化 HTML 与 ARIA</a>介绍了 <code>role</code> 属性对键盘行为的语义声明；<a href=\"dynamic-content-live-regions\">动态内容与 Live Regions</a>介绍如何配合焦点管理通知动态内容变化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>键盘管理的核心实践要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>保持 Tab 顺序与视觉顺序一致，避免使用 <code>tabindex</code> 正整数</li>\n<li>使用 <code>:focus-visible</code> 提供清晰的焦点指示，绝不用 CSS 移除所有焦点样式</li>\n<li>为模态框实现焦点陷阱，打开时聚焦第一个元素，关闭时归还焦点给触发元素</li>\n<li>为每个页面提供跳过导航链接（WCAG 2.4.1），减少键盘用户的重复操作</li>\n<li>用 <code>tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;</code> 标记编程聚焦目标，确保动态内容（错误消息、新内容区域）可被聚焦</li>\n<li>遵循 ARIA APG 的复合组件键盘交互模式（方向键在组件内导航，Tab 进出组件）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"键盘与焦点管理：让界面对键盘完全可操作","id":"键盘与焦点管理-让界面对键盘完全可操作"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Tab 顺序的基本规则","id":"tab-顺序的基本规则"},{"level":2,"text":"焦点可见性","id":"焦点可见性"},{"level":2,"text":"焦点陷阱：模态对话框的焦点管理","id":"焦点陷阱-模态对话框的焦点管理"},{"level":2,"text":"Dialog 组件的完整焦点管理","id":"dialog-组件的完整焦点管理"},{"level":2,"text":"旁路导航（Skip Navigation）","id":"旁路导航-skip-navigation"},{"level":2,"text":"复合组件的键盘交互模式","id":"复合组件的键盘交互模式"},{"level":2,"text":"常见焦点管理缺陷","id":"常见焦点管理缺陷"},{"level":2,"text":"与相关章节的关系","id":"与相关章节的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"语义化 HTML 与 ARIA：构建正确的语义层","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-engineering/implementation/semantic-html-aria"},"next":{"title":"动态内容与 Live Regions：实时变化的无障碍通知","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-engineering/implementation/dynamic-content-live-regions"}}